{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Have you ever dropped a ball and watched it fall to the ground?","words":[[0,0.26],[0.3,0.4],[0.48,0.7],[0.77,1.15],[1.17,1.22],[1.28,1.59],[1.66,1.78],[1.86,2.22],[2.26,2.37],[2.44,2.73],[2.81,2.88],[2.95,3.02],[3.08,3.95]]},{"text":"The reason the ball falls down is because of a force called gravity.","words":[[0,0.21],[0.29,0.64],[0.7,0.77],[0.82,1.09],[1.18,1.56],[1.61,1.94],[2.01,2.11],[2.18,2.55],[2.6,2.67],[2.74,2.79],[2.88,3.3],[3.35,3.66],[3.74,4.83]]},{"text":"Gravity is an invisible pull that brings things toward the Earth.","words":[[0,0.61],[0.69,0.81],[0.87,0.96],[1.04,1.78],[1.85,2.15],[2.22,2.38],[2.45,2.8],[2.88,3.22],[3.27,3.65],[3.69,3.79],[3.89,4.69]]},{"text":"Gravity keeps your feet on the ground so you don’t float away.","words":[[0,0.55],[0.61,0.92],[0.96,1.1],[1.17,1.42],[1.47,1.57],[1.61,1.68],[1.74,2.15],[2.23,2.36],[2.44,2.53],[2.59,2.84],[2.93,3.27],[3.34,4.09]]},{"text":"When you jump up high, gravity pulls you back down.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.31,0.38],[0.46,0.73],[0.8,0.94],[1.08,1.57],[1.95,2.45],[2.52,2.81],[2.87,2.94],[3.01,3.23],[3.31,4.09]]},{"text":"Look up when it rains! Every raindrop falls from the clouds because gravity tugs it down.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.38,0.5],[0.56,0.72],[0.78,0.87],[0.96,1.6],[1.99,2.3],[2.39,2.96],[3.06,3.45],[3.51,3.69],[3.75,3.82],[3.88,4.34],[4.41,4.76],[4.82,5.32],[5.39,5.7],[5.76,5.86],[5.92,6.73]]},{"text":"It even keeps the oceans and air around the Earth.","words":[[0,0.17],[0.23,0.44],[0.52,0.82],[0.87,0.96],[1.06,1.53],[1.59,1.71],[1.8,2.09],[2.16,2.5],[2.54,2.63],[2.74,3.48]]},{"text":"The Moon has gravity too, but it is weaker than Earth’s gravity.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.26,0.48],[0.56,0.74],[0.84,1.32],[1.39,1.83],[2.13,2.31],[2.37,2.46],[2.52,2.65],[2.75,3.16],[3.22,3.38],[3.47,3.84],[3.9,4.83]]},{"text":"Without gravity, everything would float around!","words":[[0,0.49],[0.56,1.22],[1.26,1.76],[1.81,2.04],[2.11,2.5],[2.57,3.48]]},{"text":"Gravity is the invisible force that keeps our world together.","words":[[0,0.61],[0.7,0.84],[0.88,0.95],[1.02,1.65],[1.73,2.16],[2.21,2.37],[2.44,2.76],[2.83,3.02],[3.1,3.45],[3.51,4.37]]}]}